  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 38ac8ab55697595439f1d4e8f0850b0c, type: 3}
  m_Name: MindReiji2
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogues:
  - "\"Think about it! 'American Idiot' came out over twenty years ago, but it perfectly
    predicts how social media and constant news streams control our brains today.
    It\u2019s like we're all being taught what to think by a digital teacher that
    never sleeps.\""
  - '"True, but back then, we actually talked to each other face-to-face. Now, my
    family group chat is just an endless stream of political memes and minion jokes.
    The ultimate disconnect."'
  - "\"Exactly! We're hyper-connected but totally isolated. It\u2019s like a multiplayer
    video game where everyone is playing on separate servers, muting their teammates,
    and just trying to get the highest individual score.\""
  - "\"So I was playing Guitar Hero last night\u2014hitting 100% on 'Boulevard of
    Broken Dreams'"
  - '"Man, that''s heavy for a Sunday afternoon. I think you need to put down the
    fake guitar and go touch some real grass."'
  - "\"It\u2019s always the ones with the worst secrets who bark the loudest. It\u2019s
    just like high school all over again. Remember how the teachers used to whisper
    about which students wouldn't make it? Society thrives on tearing people down
    for entertainment.\""
  - '"Exactly. It''s all just a game to them, but the stakes are real people''s lives."'
  imageNext:
  - {fileID: 0}
